{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40014","headline":"和尚书咏烟 · 徐夤","name":"和尚书咏烟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无根无蒂结还融，曾触岚光彻底空。\n不散几知离毕雨，欲飞须待落花风。\n玲珑薄展蛟绡片，羃历轻含凤竹丛。\n琼什捧来思旧隐，扑窗穿户晓溟蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}